class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178779#post1178779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> no fanlines until the official lines have players so maybe make a official line character first, but keep the genius in reserve. One a scale of one to WoD I say 4-5 depending on the situation. There will be some goofy teen movie stuff mixed in with the serious fantasy and horror.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK, that's fine.<br /> <br /> I was just wondering. In that case, I think I'll probably have a Mage, a Mastigos with a focus on Mind who Awakened in a Mystery Play focused on the myth of Achilles, whose name he took as his Shadow Name. He's a sports-person - pretty much the stereotypical jock, if not quite as dickish, and<br /> <i>very</i> driven when he wants to do something - but following his Awakening he's been feeling as though there's something - someone - missing, and has been withdrawing a little, if not from the sport (I'm not sure what sport, precisely. Track, maybe?) then from the peer-group around it. He's also having a bit of a sexuality crisis, having started noticing boys as well.<br /> <br /> Does that sound OK? I'm not sure of what his relationship to the Orders would be, though. I was thinking of having his first Obsession be something like 'Who is the Spear-Carrier' or similar, referencing a figure which recurred throughout his Mystery Play, serving in the roles of friend, supporter and lover at various point. I'm not sure how the fallout of his Mystery Play would work, though, and what he actually did in 'real life'.<br /> <br /> And yes, I'll admit that I'm channeling <i>The Song of Achilles</i> for this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T08:00:28-08:00","id":1178791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178784#post1178784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">OK, that's fine.</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I was just wondering. In that case, I think I'll probably have a Mage, a Mastigos with a focus on Mind who Awakened in a Mystery Play focused on the myth of Achilles, whose name he took as his Shadow Name. He's a sports-person - pretty much the s