4-2018, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T09:00:21-08:00","id":1178814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178811#post1178811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Come to think of it, re: the high school will you be designing it, young man, or will it be more of a kind of collaborative thing?</span></span></span></div> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200bI have a few ideas, part of me wants to base it off my old high school, part of me wants to do a private school in the middle of renovations, part of me wants to do collaborative. Either way I am basing the town the school is in off my old hometown (with some modifications), because being an middle to upper class suburb that also had government housing projects (long story, one that involves another town in the county doing some underhanded stuff) allows for a lot of different character types<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"h