-players?p=1178850#post1178850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was considering a reformed bully Acanthus with the shadow name Mjolnir, but now I'm worried it's a little too close to the already suggested Achilles...<br /> <br /> I'll get to work on an alternate/backup splat concept. Probably a changeling, though I don't have the 2E rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry. I'd be happy doing an Obrimos instead, if that would help. Or even a Beast.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Obrimos might actually be better, because then I can use a spear for a Dedicated Magical Tool. All it would require is a little shuffling of dots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 01-24-2018, 01:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:04:07-08:00","id":1178869,"title":"","content":"Alright, so I expressed interest the last time this came up, and I'll express interest again.<br /> <br /> Not sure what I'd want to play. I have a few thoughts:<ul><li>A vampire that's been stuck as a sophomore for the past several years, and masks his anxiety over his inability to grow up by sarcastically mocking other people's anxieties.</li> <li>A werewolf whose Change made him a Cahalith, despite being incredibly introverted and uncomfortable around others. (The Change can be a pretty good puberty metaphor, come to think of it.)</li> <li>A Changeling who escaped Arcadia, back to the abusive parents he tried to escape. He hates them, but his Keeper is petrified of adults, so they provide some measure of protection.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:07:34-08:00","id":1178870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178869#post1178869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, so I expressed interest the last time this came up, and I'll express interest again.<br /> <br /> Not sure what I'd want to play. I have a few thoughts:<ul><li>A vampire that's been stuck as a sophomore for the past several years, and masks his anxiety over his inability to grow up by sarcastically mocking other people's anxieties.</li> <li>A werewolf whose Change made him a Cahalith, despite being incredibly introverted and uncomfortable around others. (The Change can be a pretty good puberty metaphor, come to think of it.)</li> <li>A Changeling who escaped Arcadia, back to the abusive parents he tried to escape. He hates them, but his Keeper is petrified of adults, so they provide some measure of protection.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThe werewolf and the vamp both sound good, though I have to wonder how the vamp stays active during the day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 01-24-2018, 02:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:23:26-08:00","id":1178875,"title":"","content":"Current Ideas that might work<br /> <br /> 1. Network Zero Hunter: younger, spends most of their free time of the internet. discovered the frequency when they were younger, but at that point they still thought it was an elaborate hoax or series ALA Lonelygirl15. That thought is sort of starting to waver though and right now they are fairly unsure of what to think. At least one parent always being blurry in all the pictures during the late night teacher meet certainly didn\u2019t help.<br /> 2. Revenant: 15/16-year-old who had a severe heart problem who just lost his parents to an unfortunate vampire, and became a revenant in the aftermath. Waking up shaking and finding a nearby group of revenants after a particularly nasty night, some adoption papers later he was a member of the revenant group, going to school next school year and consistently losing it the whole way through.<br /> 3. Offspring: Mom\u2019s been gone for 6 years, but at least she told him what the fucking hell was going on and tell them how to handle their personal craziness. Dad\u2019s nice at least and understands, but laying so low in school and trying to both pass and not accidently explaining special relativity in front of the class or breaking physics for a small advantage during a basic physics lesson is difficult, especially given how crazy things can get.<br /> 4. Hunter (Depends): Mom and Dad are both part of this craziness and how absurd it gets, and figuring out what kids to talk to and which ones to avoid is difficult enough without worrying which ones can kill him on a bad day, or would kill his parents given the chance or honestly so many things and that\u2019s on top of just passing and trying to make friends. Worrying about the teachers only makes matters worse.<br /> (I also considered some of the Hurt Locker ones but none of those are really what I want)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13001,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","user":"SdeSpencer","date":". 01-24-2018, 02:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:24:50-08:00","id":1178876,"title":"","content":"I'm interested, but I never did play-by post and have no idea if me living in central Europe would complicate things. I really don't know how that works, it's a little shameful bit of ignorance for me.<br /> <br /> If I manage to sort that out and there's still room, though, I can play different things. Werewolf, demon, beast, hunter, promethean or mage are all viable options for me.<br /> <br /> Not a problem to adapt to the needs of the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 01-24-2018, 02:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:27:23-08:00","id":1178877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-