lass=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178877#post1178877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bWe got a mage and a demon, and Malonkey is considering werewolf, and since you are the master of Beast stuff...</div> </div> </div> </div>Hehe, the fact people are starting to call me that almost makes me feel proud. And a little embarassed, but I can handle it<br /> <br /> Alright, I'll think about a couple of concepts. If someone else want to go Beast, though, I've got some Promethean and Hunter ideas that I think would work in the setting, so don't feel restrained by me","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:38:10-08:00","id":1178881,"title":"","content":"I'm feeling all of mine, and it should be noted my final one is actually like 20 different ideas, but all different hunter groups so it can be wrapped up into one statement.<br /> Also I could play a slasher because i actually love doing that, but i'm getting that is sort of the antisis of what you are going for with this theme. also maybe hits to close to home with actual teen murderer who revels in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:45:35-08:00","id":1178884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SdeSpencer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178881#post1178881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm feeling all of mine, and it should be noted my final one is actually like 20 different ideas, but all different hunter groups so it can be wrapped up into one statement.<br /> Also I could play a slasher because i actually love doing that, but i'm getting that is sort of the antisis of what you are going for with this theme. also maybe hits to close to home with actual teen murderer who revels in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda like the revenant and the netzo hunter myself. And yeah... no slasher","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T11:50:01-08:00","id":1178888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178884#post1178884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I kinda like the revenant and the netzo hunter myself. And yeah... no slasher</div> </div> </div> </div>That's cool. the Revenant idea is probably my least favourite, so I'm pretty much 100% going to go hunter. might go with the other hunter, but definitely Hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T12:47:21-08:00","id":1178904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178864#post1178864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry. I'd be happy doing an Obrimos instead, if that would help. Or even a Beast.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Obrimos might actually be better, because then I can use a spear for a Dedicated Magical Tool. All it would require is a little shuffling of dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>Might suggest a javelin as being slightly less conspicuous in a school setting, assuming we're supposed to keep our supernatural-ness under wraps. (Though I'm hardly one to talk; my guy's tool is an Artifact war-hammer disguised as a pendant! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> Alright, guess I'll run my mage up the flagpole and see who salutes:<br /> <br /> Mjolnir (Sleeper name TBD) is in many ways the opposite of what your average mage might expect from someone of his Path. He's a bit dim, clumsy and tactless where the stereotypical Acanthus is quick, clever and subtle. The kid might make a decent bruiser character in a standard WoD chronicle, but as a mage he's at something of a starting disadvantage. Strong and athletic, but never really skilled or well-liked enough to be picked for sports teams, certainly not enough for anyone to pull strings when his grades slip. Even the symbolism isn't quite right (hammers traditionally being tools of the Moros)!<br /> <br /> He Awakened after a night of misadventure when his supposed friends ditched him to escape the police and he realized that the people he'd trusted were just using him. A vision of fleeing through dark and increasingly narrow back alleys overgrown with barbed-wire ended when he turned and, blindly grabbing the first thing he could reach, took a defiant swing at his pursuers... unwittingly decking one of the arresting officers. He's out of juvie now and, dimly aware that something is different about him, trying to turn his life around.<br /> <br /> (Naming yourself after a tool/weapon of the gods is probably not the best starting decision to make in a Gnostic setting when attempting to shake old habits of trusting the wrong people... but hey, the thing followed him back from Arcadia, and it was the first thing to come up when he Googled &quot;magic hammer.&quot;)<br /> <br /> As implied, I'm planning to spend some of his starting merit dots on an Artifact, if this meets with everyone's approval. Character concept would be &quot;blunt instrument of Fate&quot; on his sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:02:32-08:00","id":1178908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178904#post1178904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Might suggest a javelin as being slightly less conspicuous in a school setting, assuming we're supposed to keep our supernatural-ness under wraps. (Though I'm hardly one to talk; my guy's tool is an Artifact war-hammer disguised as a pendant! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't mean a full spear. The idea was that his Tool was a bronze spearhead which he found during his Mystery Play, which he (coincidentally) uses as a pendant. Great minds, I suppose. When he's got the time and privacy he binds the Tool to the end of a stave. It works on its own, but he prefers it as a proper spear. It's more feeling than actual effectiveness, but... well.<br /> <br /> The mage sounds cool, though. Are you going to take any points in Hallow? What do you think of sharing dots in Hallow, but not actually being aware of the other? I don't know if Mjolnir will be aware enough of Magely stuff to do that kind of thing. My character <i>has</i> a Mentor (1-dot, a Mage of a Nameless Order who found him and basically gave him the cliffnotes version of Magery, along with contact details 'just in case') so he knows the basic-basics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 01-24-2018, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:25:31-08:00","id":1178915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178908#post1178908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't mean a full spear. The idea was that his Tool was a bronze spearhead which he found during his Mystery Play, which he (coincidentally) uses as a pendant. Great minds, I suppose. When he's got the time and privacy he binds the Tool to the end of a stave. It works on its own, but he prefers it as a proper spear. It's more feeling than actual effectiveness, but... well.<br /> <br /> The mage sounds cool, though. Are you going to take any points in Hallow? What do you think of sharing dots in Hallow, but not actually being aware of the other? I don't know if Mjolnir will be aware enough of Magely stuff to do that kind of thing. My character <i>has</i> a Mentor (1-dot, a Mage of a Nameless Order who found him and basically gave him the cliffnotes version of Magery, along with contact details 'just in case') so he knows the basic-basics.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is a good question knowbody, how does your mage know mage stuff?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:35:49-08:00","id":1178918,"title":"","content":"If your still looking for more players I think I can play if its in discord and depending on the time. For characters I got some I've been wanting to play as.<br /> <br /> 1) A young Stricken Sin Eater who died due to the flu. Due to his death he has become semi apathetic while his Geist is always compelling him to be more active in life.<br /> 2) I have a Anakim or Namtaru Tyrant beast who's main course of feeding is joining the clubs such as boxing feasting on people dread at facing him.<br /> 3) Right now I have just a concept of a Promethean though the only thing I can think of is that hes a Tammuz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfros