nir will be aware enough of Magely stuff to do that kind of thing. My character <i>has</i> a Mentor (1-dot, a Mage of a Nameless Order who found him and basically gave him the cliffnotes version of Magery, along with contact details 'just in case') so he knows the basic-basics.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be down to share dots in a Hallow merit. Somewhere on campus? I honestly haven't decided on whether he has a Mentor or not yet; figured most of his understanding so far is a mix of trial-and-error with whatever online or book research he's been able to manage, since we're saving the Orders for later. Maybe a guidance counselor or something...?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:49:11-08:00","id":1178921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178919#post1178919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ahh gotcha.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I'd be down to share dots in a Hallow merit. Somewhere on campus? I honestly haven't decided on whether he has a Mentor or not yet; figured most of his understanding so far is a mix of trial-and-error with whatever online or book research he's been able to manage, since we're saving the Orders for later. Maybe a guidance counselor or something...?</div> </div> </div> </div>The hollow would probably be somewhere in one of the courtyards between the wings of the school if it is on campus. If off campus, then I have a few suggestions that will save until you decide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:49:53-08:00","id":1178922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178918#post1178918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If your still looking for more players I think I can play if its in discord and depending on the time. For characters I got some I've been wanting to play as.<br /> <br /> 1) A young Stricken Sin Eater who died due to the flu. Due to his death he has become semi apathetic while his Geist is always compelling him to be more active in life.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like this one a lot. I also like the beast concept, but I am waiting to see what Cinder's concepts are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:52:23-08:00","id":1178924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178919#post1178919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be down to share dots in a Hallow merit. Somewhere on campus? I honestly haven't decided on whether he has a Mentor or not yet; figured most of his understanding so far is a mix of trial-and-error with whatever online or book research he's been able to manage, since we're saving the Orders for later. Maybe a guidance counselor or something...?</div> </div> </div> </div>Re: the Hallow, I was actually thinking somewhere a little way outside town, maybe a place where a brook flows in a little babbling waterfall over a mossy boulder. In the book it says that Hallows are typically 'special' places, places where 'everything seems more real'. You might be able to, but I can't really imagine a place like that on a high school campus. The kids would take it over within a week; I should know. I'm open to suggestions, though. I've sunk 2 dots into Hallow so far. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:58:25-08:00","id":1178926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178924#post1178924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Re: the Hallow, I was actually thinking somewhere a little way outside town, maybe a place where a brook flows in a little babbling waterfall over a mossy boulder. In the book it says that Hallows are typically 'special' places, places where 'everything seems more real'. You might be able to, but I can't really imagine a place like that on a high school campus. The kids would take it over within a week; I should know. I'm open to suggestions, though. I've sunk 2 dots into Hallow so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes sense to me. I need to figure out how many dots are going into the Artifact merit, then whatever's left will go toward Hallow and Mentor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T13:58:58-08:00","id":1178927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178924#post1178924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Re: the Hallow, I was actually thinking somewhere a little way outside town, maybe a place where a brook flows in a little babbling waterfall over a mossy boulder. In the book it says that Hallows are typically 'special' places, places where 'everything seems more real'. You might be able to, but I can't really imagine a place like that on a high school campus. The kids would take it over within a week; I should know. I'm open to suggestions, though. I've sunk 2 dots into Hallow so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>my old town had a nature preserve only accessible via the cart paths (FYI my hometown was number 2 on this <a href=\"http://www.cracked.com/blog/4-small-towns-with-really-bizarre-claims-to-fame_p2/\" target=\"_blank\">cracked </a>list) it was a swampy area with a board walk running over it, and hardly anyone went there, would that work?<br /> <br /> and so far we have two magi, a hunter, a demon and a number of possible other splats. so while the others decide on their concepts, I shall some details on the town this is set in, if that is okay? If you don't like the town, then we can do it collaboratively The following is the stuff even a mortal teenager would know<br /> <br /> So the town is a mashup of the aforementioned Peachtree City and Beaufort South Carolina, and a couple other towns which I will call The Town of Mangham, a small town on the Georgia coast with a bit of an artsy yet southern character, the nearby air force base Fort Holiday is a major economic force for the town, along with the tourism industry based on visiting things like the Jadebranch Plantation House (allegedly haunted), eco tourists coming to see the swamps and the nearby Gullah corridor, along with fans of a popular Southern Gothic drama series filmed in the next town over (right past the high school actually). The town is mostly lower-middle to upper class, but there are poorer residents in the Harmony Village housing projects, who are somewhat resented by the upper class folks for bring down the property values and school test scores. There aren't many chain eateries in town, since the local restaurants, such the Partner's Pizza joint and the Pita are just that good, but shopping is mostly done at chain big box stores or amazon, with the upper class residents shopping at The Avenues (nothing but over priced clothing and electronics).<br /> <br /> The town is divided into a series of &quot;villages&quot; each with it's own shopping center and housing developments, ranging from the rather nice Broughton village to the somewhat grungy McKendrick village. Assume the town has a libary and all the other public services except or public transit, which is unneeded due to the golf cart paths<br /> <br /> And yes, there are golf cart paths, since the town is so eco tourism driven.<br /> <br /> Any questions?<br /> (more to come if you want it)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 01-24-2018, 05:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T14:01:12-08:00","id":1178929,"title":"","content":"Hmm. I had a younger Demon NPC (Ezekiel, no points for guessing the Incarnation, and an Inquisitor) I've used before that I could age up (Covers do age, after all), but if there is already a Demon and we are aiming for variety, I'll mind my other notes for ideas.<br /> <br /> What kind of XP are we building with? Fresh Char-Gen?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T14:01:19-08:00","id":1178930,"title":"","content":"i think i'm gonna use my Network Zero idea with small parts of his more fleshed out backstory taken from other ideas i've had here and there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T14:08:21-08:00","id":1178934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178927#post1178927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> my old town had a nature preserve only accessible via the cart paths (FYI my hometown was number 2 on this <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.cracked.com/blog/4-small-towns-with-really-bizarre-claims-to-fame_p2/&amp;quot;]cracked</a> [/URL]list) it was a swampy area with a board walk running over it, and hardly anyone went there, would that work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds alright to me. What would the Tass look like, though? I have an idea that it might manifest in sparks that float above the swampy area and look a lot like fireflies, but aren't, and are gathered by capturing them with your hands, although they do flock towards mages to a degree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T14:13:12-08:00","id":1178935,"title":"","content":"Quick question if I am going to be using my sin eater will I have to use some sort of modified rule set or something seeing as there isn't a 2nd edition of geist out now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T14:14:36-08:00","id":1178936,"title":"","content":"Here's what I came up with so far:<br /> <br /> - Anakim Nemesis. Youngest son of a family involved with the law (dad and a brother are cops, another is a lawyer), struggles between what he feels to be right and what adults say it is. Used to be trust authorities pre-Devouring, now not so much. Hates hypocrisy and being told to &quot;leave things to grown ups&quot;. Mental/Physical<br /> - Eshmaki/Makara Ravager. Actually a rather chill person, but the face of a thug and some bad apples in the family make it so that everyone expects him to take the wrong decisions in life. Years of being treated like that left a mark and now he kinda fits the profile of &quot;problematic student&quot;. Some anger issues and plenty of frustration, but he'd like nothing more than to be treated fairly. Physical/Social<br /> - Namtaru Collector. This one likes to keep around misfits and losers as friends, feeling some connection with them. He's genuine in that and overall a decent friend, but also deep down against the idea of them changing, finding new friends or leaving the social circle he built. His biggest fear is to be left alone. Social/Mental.<br /> <br /> Also, an Unfleshed Promethean made by the science teacher, now living the student life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T14:31:00-08:00","id":1178939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178935#post1178935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick question if I am going to be using my sin eater will I have to use some sort of modified rule set or something seeing as there isn't a 2nd edition of geist out now.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think aspel has a 1.5e conversion somewhere around here. I thin we can use that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-d