,"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T15:14:32-08:00","id":1178965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1178744-cofd-highschool-game-looking-for-players?p=1178961#post1178961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Should we start posting characters now?</div> </div> </div> </div>.<br /> Give me a little bit to come up with some scenarios but do post the character now so I can get ideas for scenarios. I am kind of winging this, so be warned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T15:47:24-08:00","id":1178977,"title":"","content":"I do have a few different ideas so I'll give a quick summary of the main concepts I have that I'd like to play.<br /> <br /> A) A tempter demon who works as much via proxy as they can. Their moda operandi is to empower mortals and twist them into being their tool, all the while hiding behind the mask of a story that is not the truth. This demon tempts these marks not with power or such Faustian bargains but by giving them a purpose and convincing them that they are special - that only they can fulfil a role in the grand design of fate. Each of these proxies are of great value and investments of both time and resources so though they are by design disposable they are not cast aside without purpose. As it is their design this demon goes by Proxy.<br /> <br /> B) A simpler concept here is a moros mage with the familiar ghost of his twin that died in the same event that awoke the moros. As such, this mage take's great pleasure in their awakening and values ghosts highly. Their goal is to one day give their twin a body once more. Yes, even if this ghost is not truly, fully their twin such is still a dream.<br /> <br /> I feel these two concepts would be the easiest of mine to weave into a high school setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T16:46:01-08:00"